     "source_location": "Table 1, journal page 496",
     "notes": "All 14 printed sample P-V observations are bundled. The accessible primary abstract does not identify the exact pressure gauge or equation; primary methods evidence is still required before a scale or executable normalization edge can be assigned."
    }
   ]
