    "audit_date": "2026-10-08",
    "notes": "Primary methods explicitly cite Mao et al. (1978), not Mao et al. (1986). No pressure-transmitting medium. Source temperatures are described as room temperature; the existing 298 K model reference is unchanged."
   },
